    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/c67d624af9f95b98806ed3d272ca7099.poster.avif?t=1755356350\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/c67d624af9f95b98806ed3d272ca7099.webm?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/c67d624af9f95b98806ed3d272ca7099.mp4?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELARIENNE: Everything Comes Down to Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ELARIENNE is a pure luck-based defense game where every summon can change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A defense game where luck shapes your army\u2014and strategy keeps you alive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit is summoned randomly\u2014from the most basic tier all the way to the ultra-rare tier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 8 tiers in total, and each unit belongs to one of three races: Humans, Elves, or Orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race has its own distinct combat traits, making team-building both exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to build your dream army? You\u2019ll need some serious luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As darkness spreads across the land, only fortune can protect the world of ELARIENNE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck in this ultimate defense challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/2507e1cecc237e51a7f9d48abfb5df67.poster.avif?t=1755356350\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/2507e1cecc237e51a7f9d48abfb5df67.webm?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/2507e1cecc237e51a7f9d48abfb5df67.mp4?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Runes: Luck or Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What matters more\u2014luck or strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Epic bosses to choose from three random runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune gives you another chance to shape your strategy\u2014or roll the dice again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/7f473fd8200641396b7bf9e6ef9797ab.poster.avif?t=1755356350\" width=616 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/7f473fd8200641396b7bf9e6ef9797ab.webm?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/7f473fd8200641396b7bf9e6ef9797ab.mp4?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive 150 Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies appear in waves and follow a fixed looping path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t defeat them, they stay on the field and stack with future waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let 100 enemies build up on the map, or fail to kill a boss before time runs out, and your run ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When too many monsters gather, the darkness consumes ELARIENNE and the world falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the line before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/31790e78aecc4aac451e6dab9efb3899.poster.avif?t=1755356350\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/31790e78aecc4aac451e6dab9efb3899.webm?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/31790e78aecc4aac451e6dab9efb3899.mp4?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Yet Tactical</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The units you summon shape how you choose runes and upgrades\u2014turning randomness into strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will luck be on your side? Or will you fall to the darkness?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/c67d624af9f95b98806ed3d272ca7099.poster.avif?t=1755356350\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/c67d624af9f95b98806ed3d272ca7099.webm?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/c67d624af9f95b98806ed3d272ca7099.mp4?t=1755356350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELARIENNE: Everything Comes Down to Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ELARIENNE is a pure luck-based defense game where every summon can change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A defense game where luck shapes your army\u2014and strategy keeps you alive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit is summoned randomly\u2014from the most basic tier all the way to the ultra-rare tier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 8 tiers in total, and each unit belongs to one of three races: Humans, Elves, or Orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race has its own distinct combat traits, making team-building both exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to build your dream army? You\u2019ll need some serious luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As darkness spreads across the land, only fortune can protect the world of ELARIENNE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck in this ultimate defense challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/2507e1cecc237e51a7f9d48abfb5df67.poster.avif?t=1755356350\" width=616 h